  "conclusion": {
    "points": [
      "5\nAbstract\nA persistent air leak is most commonly caused by a\nsecondary spontaneous pneumothorax from underlying\nlung disease",
      "There are several treatment options, which\nalso depend on the underlying cause",
      "Possible treatment\noptions include conservative measures (larger-bore chest\ndrains, pleurodesis) or surgical treatment"
    ],
